1
00:00:00,501 --> 00:00:02,411
(Raj:)I'll be over here
basting my ass off.

2
00:00:02,570 --> 00:00:04,020
(Raj:)Focus is key.

3
00:00:04,238 --> 00:00:07,148
(Amy:)Did you guys know Penny
married Zack three years ago?

4
00:00:07,308 --> 00:00:09,088
(Together:)-What?
-Wha...?

5
00:00:14,582 --> 00:00:15,922
(Howard:)You ever play football?

6
00:00:16,083 --> 00:00:17,563
(Mike:)A little in college.

7
00:00:17,718 --> 00:00:19,718
(Sheldon:)-You?
-No.

8
00:00:19,887 --> 00:00:22,557
(Howard:)But I did get tackled
in the hallway once.

9
00:00:24,392 --> 00:00:27,272
(Howard:)The whole school cheered.

10
00:00:29,930 --> 00:00:31,170
I found the, court papers

11
00:00:31,332 --> 00:00:32,602
(Leonard:)that you and Zack
need to fill out.

12
00:00:32,767 --> 00:00:34,367
(Leonard:)-I'll print them when we get home.
-Fine.

13
00:00:34,535 --> 00:00:36,675
(Leonard:)And we can just put this
whole thing behind us.

14
00:00:36,837 --> 00:00:37,607
(Penny:)Are you done?

15
00:00:37,772 --> 00:00:39,442
(Together:)-What?
-Look, I get it, I screwed up.

16
00:00:39,573 --> 00:00:41,243
Is this all we're going to talk
about the rest of the day?

17
00:00:41,275 --> 00:00:42,375
(Leonard:)Why are you mad at me?

18
00:00:42,543 --> 00:00:43,853
(Leonard:)You're the one that
did the stupid thing.

19
00:00:43,944 --> 00:00:46,754
(Leonard:)-I'm just trying to fix it.
-(GROANS) I need some air.

20
00:00:47,248 --> 00:00:48,628
Well... Penny.

21
00:00:48,783 --> 00:00:50,523
Now, I don't know the
first thing about women,

22
00:00:50,684 --> 00:00:52,524
(Sheldon:)but I would not follow her.

23
00:00:55,456 --> 00:01:03,026
(Mike:)Listen to Stretch.

